A47D6F7"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "139549390805633", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_768510353320152_9100528013614776320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E1IDn9wW7qwQ7kNvwFXgFN7&_nc_oc=Adp_-w-yV-QkPqiTY_OeYyo-UKqeeuiA8ysZ0vDDvBq2evFFXpSHIfOAcJ0HMhOxjiA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_G713h_8XhRtA9hKYZgZWUsFK-0kdYodAMQsD9FreBZg&oe=6A47AB76"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoThumb_2560x1440.png", "id": "347740935677671", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162743_347740939011004_7535046003687161856_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y3RZ4JsHHhYQ7kNvwGW_25M&_nc_oc=AdrmcFFcQrX09HpEvCVbpsDZEFedyRwSUo4NNj-PYjAMdoyP49LvlGIG1oA5mokmg88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8xUX2lpclAwhNVXtXr4F-nkyVXjax-sHywu9JuQgs71w&oe=6A47B5B9"}, "display_name": "PaperLander Demo", "keywords": ["paper", "rocket", "gravity", "cute", "free"], "long_description": "PaperLander is a fragile rocket made out of - you guessed it - paper. He lives in PaperGalaxy, a low gravitational fantasy world far far away, made mostly out of paper too.\n\nBut now the Galaxy is in danger. A Space Storm is approaching and threatens to tear it apart. Only one thing can stop the Storm: The Great Anti-Storm Ion Cannon! But it works only with Proto-Stars. And Proto-Stars are scattered in the Galaxy, across its many Sectors. These Sectors are connected by a network of teleporters that activate upon landing. PaperLander's mission is to find and collect those Stars, pass through the Sectors using the teleporters and bring them to the Anti-Storm Ion Cannon in time to save the Galaxy!\n\nBuild your own PaperLander here: http://thiswayupgames.com/PaperLanderModel.pdf\n\n--------------------------------\n\nPlease note that the game might run a bit slower on some Galaxy S7 phones due to low performance graphics 